summary:
  This daily radiology news briefing highlights practice-changing research in infectious diseases, oncology, and novel therapeutic approaches. Several articles focus on recent scientific discoveries with potential clinical implications, alongside administrative updates and a review of career trends in the field.
  The top stories cover advancements in antibiotic resistance, the immune system's role in colorectal cancer, and potential new strategies for managing metabolic diseases, offering insights into evolving diagnostic and treatment landscapes.

